    "body": "Here's the investigation result.\r\nThis behavior is caused by [`renames_index_to_workdir()` ](https://docs.rs/git2/0.7.5/git2/struct.StatusOptions.html#method.renames_index_to_workdir) option (src/modules/git_status.rs:202)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if Starship needs it, but I've found out it was introduced here (which doesn't help either): https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/247/files\r\n\r\n",
